It could have been a shapechanger, ie. a chameleon or a doppelganger.
They're great for pets if you've got the 'charm monster' spell (or if
they change into something domestic, ie. a cat, dog, or pony, when you
can feed it to tame it) as they can turn into pretty tough monsters to
take care of those pesty peaceful @'s, including the Oracle after
you've fed her all of your zorkmids. :)

But if you must kill it, you'd better wait around to see if it turns
into something wimpy. Eating the corpse has the same effect as quaffing
a !oPolymorph, so you should probably refrain from doing so. (If you're
a non-troglodyte human, eating a doppelganger will give you all the bad
stuff that comes with cannabalism.)



